created: 2026-11-21T00:00:00Z
decided: human:x
status: verified
replaces: [20261101-000000-old-o1o1]
relates: [20261110-000000-plain-p1p1]
---

zebraword new
-- broken.md --
---
kind: note
kind: note
---
-- ff.md --
